Stolen Sword for GifOS is an unofficial port of Stolen Sword
(https://github.com/chiaogu/stolen-sword) by chiaogu / Ian Chiao, MIT.

This copy is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or maintained by the original
author. Bugs in the GifOS wrap go to GifOS, not upstream.

The original work is a one-finger action platformer written for js13kGames
2020. GifOS adds a localStorage stand-in over gifos.db, touch that does not
scroll the page, and ghost swordsmen over a meeting link. The campaign,
drawing, and sounds are chiaogu's.

Sounds use zzfx (Zuper Zmall Zound Zynth) as bundled by upstream.
